      "name": "Config",
      "docs": [
        "Global platform config. PDA: [\"config\"].",
        "",
        "The platform admin can only pause *delegate* spending. It can never move",
        "user funds, and it can never block an owner from withdrawing."
      ],
      "type": {
        "kind": "struct",
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "admin",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
